{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reject relative filesystem references\n\nThe v1 envelope requires `file` to be absolute, but `toAbsolutePath()` silently accepts a relative reference whenever it resolves beneath `basePath`. This makes malformed checkpoints dependent on the process working directory and potentially non-replayable after an environment change. Validate `isAbsolute()` before normalization and add a relative-reference regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ohqXX","finding_digest":"6cc84a2fdff7309129d07c1deafbe5b1977dd72a83e7097b24ca069056ccd374","finding_id":"arf_v1_nteeul6764yjckoqpqo6v67fwg","finding_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::readpayload::absolute-file-reference","identity_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::readpayload::absolute-file-reference","line":242,"observation_digest":"4db232fba0fa824554b211a81fd74c387223894e16c2f0dc56ccd2a8d5689f37","observation_id":"aro_v1_jwzdf65a7kbekvfscgub7v2mhb","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/FileSystemSerDesStage.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T05:48:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tiwtivaw6jkkrh6pmgdnyydwem","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"8a3926abb26c4a64d6d337b17b48fda3bcaaeb99","reviewer":"codex","start_line":242,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_a37ejzxqqs7h7zhpax5olzhgjn"},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_mghm2yrqaofuhfl4lgg6tqvxnh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T05:48:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
